Apply per-user access rules.

## H. Google Trends API — Optional

Use only if access is granted to the official API.

The current Google Trends API is in an alpha access program. Do not make the product depend on automatic approval.

Fallback:
- Trends website research.
- Approved search provider.
- YouTube public search data.

